1581:                H->>SL: record packageId on the turn
1582:                H->>M: prompt with conversation history
1583:            end
1584:            M-->>H: answer with claims and evidence
1585:            H->>AC: POST /responses (SubmitAgentResponseCommand) with invocationMode
